#. Runtime JSON key: build_materials.next_insufficient
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "材料适用，但本体库存不足。可以安排蓝图；完工前需要取得更多材料。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.BUILD_MATERIALS.NEXT_INSUFFICIENT"
msgid "Material is compatible, but native stock is insufficient. A blueprint can be queued; acquire more material before completion."
msgstr "素材は適合しますが、本体在庫が不足しています。設計図は予約できますが、完成までに素材の調達が必要です。"

#. Runtime JSON key: build_materials.next_unknown
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "材料适用；需求量或本体库存未知。不要认定材料充足。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.BUILD_MATERIALS.NEXT_UNKNOWN"
msgid "Material is compatible; required quantity or native stock is unknown. Do not assume sufficient material."
msgstr "素材は適合しますが、必要量または本体在庫は未取得です。充足していると判断しないでください。"

#. Runtime JSON key: build_materials.next_not_required
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "自由建造模式不需要材料库存。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.BUILD_MATERIALS.NEXT_NOT_REQUIRED"
msgid "Material stock is not required in free-build mode."
msgstr "資材消費なしの建築モードでは、素材在庫は不要です。"

#. Runtime JSON key: build_materials.next_sufficient
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "材料适用且本体材料选择数量充足；尚未评估向此施工点配送。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.BUILD_MATERIALS.NEXT_SUFFICIENT"
msgid "Material is compatible and the native material-selection quantity is sufficient; delivery to this site is not evaluated."
msgstr "素材は適合し、本体の素材選択量は充足しています。この施工先への配送は未評価です。"

#. Runtime JSON key: build_materials.retry_with_auto
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "如果不要求精确材料，请使用 material=auto 或 material={0} 重试。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.BUILD_MATERIALS.RETRY_WITH_AUTO"
msgid "Retry with material=auto or material={0} if exact material is not required."
msgstr "素材を厳密に指定する必要がなければ、material=auto または material={0} で再試行してください。"

#. Runtime JSON key: build_materials.inspect_candidates
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "当前没有可用材料；重试前请检查库存和材料候选。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.BUILD_MATERIALS.INSPECT_CANDIDATES"
msgid "No usable material is currently available; inspect inventory and material candidates before retrying."
msgstr "現在利用できる素材がありません。再試行前に在庫と素材候補を確認してください。"

#. Runtime JSON key: build_materials.suggest_material
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "请使用 material=auto 或 material={0}"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.BUILD_MATERIALS.SUGGEST_MATERIAL"
msgid "Use material=auto or material={0}"
msgstr "material=auto または material={0} を使用してください"

#. Runtime JSON key: build_materials.suggest_inspect
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "重试前请通过 world_editor /active/resources/inventory.oni 或 building_control domain=planning action=materials 检查。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.BUILD_MATERIALS.SUGGEST_INSPECT"
msgid "Inspect world_editor /active/resources/inventory.oni or building_control domain=planning action=materials before retrying."
msgstr "再試行前に world_editor /active/resources/inventory.oni または building_control domain=planning action=materials で確認してください。"

#. Runtime JSON key: tile_replacement.terrain_unverifiable
#. Runtime zh-Hans msgstr: "原单元格为 Solid=true 且 Foundation=false；常规替换在发送建造操作前拒绝此未经验证的地形状态。"
msgctxt "OniMcp.MCP.TILE_REPLACEMENT.TERRAIN_UNVERIFIABLE"
msgid "The original cell has Solid=true and Foundation=false; ordinary replacement refuses this unverified terrain state before the build gesture."
msgstr "元セルはSolid=trueかつFoundation=falseです。地形の根拠を確認できないため、通常交換の建築操作を送信しません。"
